        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm gat Yɛ-ɣo-ram min tɔt jak ka kuäär kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ. Kɛ ɣöö tëë kɛ ji̱ Ä-rab ti ci ben pɛɛc ca gaat Yɛ-ɣo-ram tin di̱t näk ni kɛn diaal. Inɔ cu Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ram kuäär Juda ruëc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë tookɛ kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ rɛw, kä cuɛ ruëc kɛ ruɔ̱n kɛl kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa, nya Ɔmri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni duɔ̱p dhɔaar Ɛ̈-ɣab, kä cu man ɛ buath dui̱rä kɛ ɣöö ɛ jɛn la lueekdɛ mɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ce̱tkɛ tëë ca la̱t ɛ dhɔr Ɛ̈-ɣab. Kɛ ɣöö kɛ kɔr liëth gua̱n, cu ka kɛn luëëkɛ tin cu jɛ jak kä pɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ liŋ ni luekdiɛn, kä cukɛ wä kɛɛl kɛnɛ Yo-ram gat Ɛ̈-ɣab kua̱r thuk duëli kuec caam kɛ ɣöö bikɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ Ɣä-dha-el kuäär A-thi-ri-ya kä Ra-moth-gil-yad. Kä cu ji̱ A-thi-ri-ya Yo-ram moc kɛ buɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä kä Yidh-rɛɛl kɛ ɣöö bi buɔ̱tdɛ min ca ka̱m jɛ ɛ ji̱ A-thi-ri-ya kä Rama, mëë nyiëënyɛ kɛ Ɣä-dha-el kuäär A-thi-ri-ya wä gɔaa thi̱n. Kä cu Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ram kuäär Juda wä, wëë Yo-ram gat Ɛ̈-ɣab gui̱l kɛ buɔ̱tdɛ kä Yidh-rɛɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Pɛ̈ɛ̈n Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa nööŋ kɛ gui̱lɛ kɛ Yo-ram. Kä mëë cɛ cop, cukɛ wä raar kɛnɛ Yo-ram wa Yeɣu gat Nim-ci lor, min ca kuany ɛ Kuoth Nhial kɛ ɣöö bɛ dhɔr Ɛ̈-ɣab däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wä Yeɣu dhɔr Ɛ̈-ɣab däk, cuɛ röm kɛ bööth Juda kɛ gaat däman Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa, tin la jäl kɛ jɛ kɛɛl, cuɛ kɛ näk ni kɛn diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa go̱r, kä cua jëk cɛ rɔ tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ kä Tha-mɛ-ria, kä cua jɛ nöŋ Yeɣu kä cuɛ jɛ näk. Kä cukɛ jɛ kony, kɛ ɣöö ɛ kɛn i̱, “Ɛ gatdöö Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat, mëë ci Kuoth Nhial pal nikɛ lɔcdɛ kɛɛliw.” Kä cuɛ thil raan dhɔr Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa mi dëë naath ruac ala kuäär.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ma̱c Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa kɛ kuäär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa man Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gatdɛ nɛn cɛ li̱w, cuɛ ji̱ dho̱r kua̱ri Juda diaal däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Yɛ-ɣo-cab-at",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yɛ-ɣo-cab-at",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yɛ-ɣo-cɛ-ba cɔalkɛ jɛ bä kɛ ciöt in dɔ̱ŋ i̱ Yɛ-ɣo-cab-at mi tekɛ gɔ̱a̱r mi dɔ̱ŋ.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nya kua̱r gat Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa ni Yo-ac kual rɛy gan kua̱r tin görkɛ näkdiɛn, kä cuɛ jɛ la̱th duëël nhial kɛnɛ ro̱o̱mdɛ. Kɛ ɣöö ɛn Yɛ-ɣo-cab-at ɛ nya kua̱r ni Yɛ-ɣo-ram kä ɛ ciek bo̱o̱th palä mi cɔal i̱ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da, Ɛ nyiman Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa. Cuɛ wä tɔ̱w kɛ Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa kɛ ɣöö /cɛ jɛ bi näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ te tɔ̱ɔ̱wä kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, kɛ run bäkɛl rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, guäth ëë ruaac Ä-thɛ̈l-yaa wec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
